"In the present case, however, it concerns a joint celebration and condemnable acts, performed publicly, in full priestly vestments on the part of the Bishop of Attica and his priests, and an offering to the Arch-Ecumenist of the principal symbols of the feast, the palm branches, which moreover were blessed. And he not only offers, but also receives from the great Ecumenist and New Calendarist Athenagoras of Ilion, for the umpteenth time, the corresponding gifts, blessed by a heretical New Calendarist and Arch-Ecumenist, fallen from the Orthodox Faith, according to the Monumental Unification Text of 2014.",
