"Now, what do the decisive Canons tell us for this case, which are the critical ones for the facts in question, under which determining Canons the subsumption must correctly be made, and which lead to the deposition of the unrepentant Bishop of Attica, fallen from the Orthodox Faith? And what do the Holy Fathers teach about our stance toward heretics (judged to be heretics — the New Calendarists — in 1983 (Saint Philaret), in 1998 (Archbishop Chrysostomos II and You) and in 2013 (the Church of Romania), but also according to the monumental Unification Text of 2014)?",
