"According, then, to the Holy Canons and the teaching of the Holy Fathers, the Bishop of Attica is already deposed and barred from the Liturgy, for his repeated wallowing together, mingling,",
"consorting, and, in the end, fraternizing with the heretical Ecumenists – New Calendarists.",
