"If our Ecclesiology has not changed and the monumental Unification Text (2014) remains as it was signed and took effect and still holds, as You confirm, then everything stated above holds exactly, since we regard the New Calendarists – Ecumenists as fallen from the Faith, and their “bishops” and “priests” as false bishops and false pastors (according to Holy Canon 15 of the First-Second Synod)! And those who consort, celebrate together, concelebrate, fraternize, cooperate, mingle and wallow with these heretics we regard as being in communion, (in a broad sense, indeed, “concelebrating”, according to the well-known university professor Dr. Petros Koutsoukos (in a broad sense concelebration (LAOS + LEITOS)!), with the Ecumenist and New Calendarist heresy, and in particular, according to the critical Holy Canons mentioned above, which we cite once more, interpreted by Saint Nikodemos, also attaching the likewise decisive text of teaching of Saint Ephraim the Syrian:",
