"“If any Bishop, or Presbyter, or Deacon, or anyone at all on the list of the Clergy fast with Jews, or celebrate a feast with them, or receive from them the gifts of their feast, such as unleavened bread, or anything of the sort —(BLESSED PALM BRANCHES RECEIVED FROM THE HERETIC)— let him be deposed; and if he be a Layman, let him be excommunicated.”",
