"What might this “unified framework for the protection of the officials of the Church” include, whose proposer seems not to realize that Christians are not daunted by persecuting tyrants, that the Church cannot bear further discord, while he is unaware that Her essence is the cultivation of concord and unity?",
"What might it mean, for this “concord and unity,” the decision of the Hierarchy of the Church of Greece for “The taking of the necessary measures to stem the wave of emergence of ‘authorities’ who act divisively within the Body of the Church”?",
"What are the necessary measures that will restrict the “authorities,” leaving this role to the “yesterday’s ‘Mitsos,’ ‘Kotsos’ or ‘Panagis’”?",
"Perhaps the excommunications? Surely, the entire Hierarchy, like the bishop of Ilion Athenagoras, know that Orthodox Christians have, involuntarily, of course, as allies the enemies of the Church, and here the bishops are not meant, but those forces that are distinguished by their anti-clerical fury and control the Media of Social Stupefaction. With the first excommunication they will even stir up the stones in order to accuse the Church of obscurantism!",
"So, if not the fear of excommunication, what measure of chastisement might this “framework for the protection of the officials” conceal, which the Hierarchy of the Church of Greece accepted? In what way will “no room be given to the persecutors of the bishops to expand”?",
"Perhaps by suspending those Priests who openly defend Orthodoxy?",
"In this way the bishops will be revealed as wolf-shepherds and will wall off not one Orthodox Priest, but hundreds of Orthodox Christians!",
"Are the “reform centers” some kind of solution? This measure has serious difficulties, because, like all “re-forming” centers of characters and beliefs, in order to be effective they must have a strict system of absolute physical and psychological control.",
"Undoubtedly, in the Hierarchy of the Church of Greece there are bishops who successfully studied the science of psychology in order to direct them, but the difficulty lies in that they must, by force, turn the Christians who believe “We ought to obey God rather than men” into inmates of these “reform centers,” with a year-long stay to complete their “training” and, after their “Ecumenist reform,” the “restored” must by all means do a six-month practicum, so that the “reformers” may be assured that their work succeeded.",
"This Orwellian version of “protection of the officials of the Church” is not among the intentions of Archbishop Ieronymos, judging, of course, from his proposals to the Permanent Holy Synod and to the Hierarchy, and, logically, should not exist even in the back of the minds of the bishops who pretend not to have heard or, if they heard, write on their purple shoes the saying of Elder Paisios: “The Church is not the ship of each bishop to do whatever he wants”!",
"So, for Christians whose only article in life is “For to me to live is Christ, and to die is gain,” obviously the content of the “unified framework for the protection of the officials of the Church” has no value, but it is worth",
"asking the Bishops: What kind of “fishers of men” are they when they decide that “extreme actions and manifestations must be avoided and issues must be dealt with prudence, sobriety and discernment, through the synodal polity of the Church,” so that “the unity between the Holy Synod and the Christian-named fullness, between faith and science!!, between Church and State!!! may not be disturbed” and at the same time adopt the proposals of the bishop of Ilion Athenagoras?",
"Finally, bishop of Ilion Athenagoras, who are “methodically undermining the foundations of the Church”? The Orthodox Christians who honor “the Preachers of piety,” who conform to the faith of the Apostles, to the faith of the Fathers of the Church, or the bishops who pray together with those of other faiths, who commune Uniates, who recognize and concelebrate with the schismatic-heretics of the Bartholomaic pseudo-church in Ukraine, the bishops who administer Holy Communion with plastic spoons and kiss the Holy Gospel and the sacred Imprints of the Lord, of the Panagia His Mother and of the Saints wearing a muzzle?",
"Who “methodically undermine the foundations of the Church,” bishop of Ilion Athenagoras?",
"The Orthodox Christians who walk with boldness the way of God, heeding the word of the Lord “Render therefore unto Caesar the things which are Caesar’s; and unto God the things that are God’s” or the bishops who applaud the statement of Archbishop Ieronymos that: “The way in which the Church and its pastors are called to function in the present age is that of tightrope walking”!!! that is, of lukewarmness! Of fear! Of calculation! Of equal distances, and in any case, the functioning of the Church and of its pastors in the manner of tightrope walking has anything but a “genuine confessional spirit.”",
"Bishop of Ilion Athenagoras, at the critical hour you will hear the voice of the Lord: “I know thy works, that thou art neither cold nor hot: I would thou wert cold or hot. So then because thou art lukewarm, and neither cold nor hot, I will spue thee out of my mouth,” because you are not bishops, but tightrope walkers!",
"It is not possible, man, to be both with Caesar and with God!",
"“And if very few remain in piety and Orthodoxy, these are the Church, and the authority and the protection of the ecclesiastical institutions lies with them,",
"even if they must suffer ill for the sake of piety”",
"(“but if the very least remain in piety and",
"orthodoxy, then they are the Church, and upon them",
"rests the validity and the protection of the ecclesiastical institutions, even if they must",
"suffer greatly for the sake of piety”)",
